{
    "info":  {
                 "_postman_id":  "91ca6890-ed5f-4b8c-9d5f-3422833b6e29",
                 "name":  "5 - Coupon Redemption",
                 "description":  "Endpoints to view coupon redemptions history.",
                 "schema":  "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
             },
    "item":  [
                 {
                     "name":  "Get Paged Coupon Redemptions",
                     "event":  [
                                   {
                                       "listen":  "test",
                                       "script":  {
                                                      "exec":  [
                                                                   "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                                                                   "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                                                                   "});",
                                                                   "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                                                                   "if (jsonData \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data.items \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data.items.length \u003e 0) {",
                                                                   "    pm.environment.set(\"couponRedemptionId\", jsonData.data.items[0].id);",
                                                                   "}"
                                                               ],
                                                      "type":  "text/javascript"
                                                  }
                                   }
                               ],
                     "request":  {
                                     "description":  "### Endpoint Overview\n\nFetches a paginated list of coupon redemptions with dynamic sorting and filtering.\n\n---\n\n### Available Domain Attributes \u0026 Filter Reference\n\n| Attribute Name | Data Type | Filter Support | Description / Allowed Values |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `Id` | `int` | Exact | Unique Identifier |\n| `CouponId` | `int` | Exact | Id of Coupon redeemed |\n| `PaymentRequestId` | `int` | Exact | Associated payment request Id |\n| `DiscountAmount` | `decimal` | Between | Applied discount amount |\n| `CreatedOn` | `DateTime` | Between | ISO format date of creation |\n| `CreatedById` | `int` | Exact | ID of user who created the record |\n| `IsActive` | `bool` | Exact | Activation status |\n\n---\n\n### Filter Usage Guide (For Request Body)\n\n- **Exact Filters (`exactFilters`):** Pass attribute name with array of string/enum values. Example: `\"exactFilters\": { \"CouponId\": [\"1\"] }`\n- **Between Filters (`betweenFilters`):** Pass attribute name with `min` and `max`. Example: `\"betweenFilters\": { \"DiscountAmount\": { \"min\": \"5\", \"max\": \"50\" } }`",
                                     "method":  "POST",
                                     "header":  [
                                                    {
                                                        "key":  "Content-Type",
                                                        "value":  "application/json"
                                                    }
                                                ],
                                     "body":  {
                                                  "mode":  "raw",
                                                  "raw":  "{\n  \"pageNumber\": 1,\n  \"pageSize\": 10,\n  \"orderBy\": \"Id\",\n  \"orderDirection\": \"asc\",\n  \"filters\": {\n    \"betweenFilters\": {},\n    \"exactFilters\": {}\n  }\n}"
                                              },
                                     "url":  {
                                                 "raw":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/CouponRedemption",
                                                 "host":  [
                                                              "{{baseUrl}}"
                                                          ],
                                                 "path":  [
                                                              "api",
                                                              "CouponRedemption"
                                                          ]
                                             }
                                 },
                     "response":  [

                                  ]
                 },
                 {
                     "name":  "Get Coupon Redemption By Id",
                     "request":  {
                                     "method":  "GET",
                                     "header":  [

                                                ],
                                     "url":  {
